{
  "displayName": "Talisman performance baselines (TL-179)",
  "dashboardFilters": [
    {
      "stringValue": ".*",
      "templateVariable": "release",
      "valueType": "STRING",
      "filterType": "VALUE_ONLY"
    }
  ],
  "gridLayout": {
    "columns": 2,
    "widgets": [
      {
        "title": "Collection contract",
        "text": {
          "format": "MARKDOWN",
          "content": "TL-179 baseline: rolling **72 hours**, normal traffic, one instrumentation release, no Tier 1 deployment during collection. Pick a release regex above (default all). Tables rank endpoints by request volume; missing/unsupported browser metrics remain absent, not zero. Latency percentiles use merged histogram buckets, not averages of per-instance percentiles.\n\n[Browser Web Vitals](https://__SENTRY_ORG__.sentry.io/insights/browser/?project=__SENTRY_PROJECT_ID__) \u00b7 [Sentry traces](https://__SENTRY_ORG__.sentry.io/traces/?project=__SENTRY_PROJECT_ID__)\n\nSelect the same release and 72-hour window in Sentry. Inspect p50/p95 LCP, INP, CLS and navigation duration with sample counts. For pool sizing, checkout includes validation; usage deltas and request-wait deltas are separate. Process cold start includes idle time until the first API reply; platform startup latency is shown separately."
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Top 20 endpoints \u2014 request count, 72h",
        "timeSeriesTable": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "prometheusQuery": "topk(20, sum by (route, method) (increase(logging_googleapis_com:user_talisman_api_duration_ms_count{monitored_resource=~\"cloud_run_.*\",environment=\"production\",release=~\"${release}\",route!=\"/api/health\",route!=\"<unmatched>\"}[72h])))",
                "outputFullDuration": true
              },
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "metricVisualization": "NUMBER"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Top 20 endpoints \u2014 p50 duration (ms), 72h",
        "timeSeriesTable": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "prometheusQuery": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, route, method) (rate(logging_googleapis_com:user_talisman_api_duration_ms_bucket{monitored_resource=~\"cloud_run_.*\",environment=\"production\",release=~\"${release}\"}[72h]))) and on (route, method) topk(20, sum by (route, method) (increase(logging_googleapis_com:user_talisman_api_duration_ms_count{monitored_resource=~\"cloud_run_.*\",environment=\"production\",release=~\"${release}\",route!=\"/api/health\",route!=\"<unmatched>\"}[72h])))",
                "outputFullDuration": true
              },
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "metricVisualization": "NUMBER"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Top 20 endpoints \u2014 p95 duration (ms), 72h",
        "timeSeriesTable": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "prometheusQuery": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route, method) (rate(logging_googleapis_com:user_talisman_api_duration_ms_bucket{monitored_resource=~\"cloud_run_.*\",environment=\"production\",release=~\"${release}\"}[72h]))) and on (route, method) topk(20, sum by (route, method) (increase(logging_googleapis_com:user_talisman_api_duration_ms_count{monitored_resource=~\"cloud_run_.*\",environment=\"production\",release=~\"${release}\",route!=\"/api/health\",route!=\"<unmatched>\"}[72h])))",
                "outputFullDuration": true
